{"unit_id":"qbclex__dsh-prompt-injector#feature-1","repo":"qbclex/dsh-prompt-injector","commit":"029ee577eceacf8ba02027051fbf25509d6aa833","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-injector 的功能「全局系统提示词注入」：把用户文本注册为 DSH 的动态系统提示词段，对所有会话生效。可通过设置页、/pinject 命令或工具注入，支持替换和追加，并限制单次文本长度。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:104-125","index.js:152-165","index.js:212-234","client.js:107-115"]}
{"unit_id":"qbclex__dsh-prompt-injector#feature-2","repo":"qbclex/dsh-prompt-injector","commit":"029ee577eceacf8ba02027051fbf25509d6aa833","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-injector 的功能「历史回退」：每次替换或追加前保存当前内容，最多保留 20 条历史。用户可按步数回退；当历史耗尽时，系统提示词段会注销并恢复无注入状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:98-102","index.js:168-185","index.js:127-132"]}
{"unit_id":"qbclex__dsh-prompt-injector#feature-3","repo":"qbclex/dsh-prompt-injector","commit":"029ee577eceacf8ba02027051fbf25509d6aa833","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-injector 的功能「本地保存和恢复」：插件将当前提示词与历史写入 state.json，启动时重新加载；设置页可查看当前内容和历史，并清空当前注入及全部历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:60-92","index.js:187-194","client.js:179-218"]}
